{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01WzWriTSKkzoMjqtcwVYi36","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"answer\\\":\\\"Based on my search of the context filesystem, I found the answer in the KIP-1312 discussion thread.\\\\n\\\\n**The error code returned when a client tries to unregister a controller ID that has no existing registration is: `BROKER_ID_NOT_REGISTERED`**\\\\n\\\\nThis is explicitly mentioned in Kevin Wu's reply to David Arthur's question about error codes for the unregister controller feature:\\\\n\\\\n> \\\\\\\"a `BROKER_ID_NOT_REGISTERED` error if no registration exists for the requested controller ID\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n**Source file:** `/store/events/2026/05/08/mail-34fa83dae238a6129c835a60-42a38647.md` (lines 47-48)\\\\n\\\\nThis is from the discussion thread on KIP-1312: Support unregistering controllers, where Kevin Wu outlines the error codes that can be returned for this feature.\\\",\\\"error\\\":null,\\\"files\\\":[\\\"store\\\",\\\"events/2026/05/08/mail-34fa83dae238a6129c835a60-42a38647.md\\\"],\\\"seconds\\\":23.91,\\\"truncated\\\":false,\\\"turns\\\":2,\\\"usage\\\":{\\\"cache_read_tokens\\\":133191,\\\"cache_write_tokens\\\":38691,\\\"cost_usd\\\":0.0979671,\\\"input_tokens\\\":66,\\\"output_tokens\\\":1440}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e581fc8c-6956-4e44-9859-7d235f37e002","uuid":"0bc1782b-8b04-417c-b5a3-5db75dcd4932","timestamp":"2026-09-27T19:23:03.752Z","tool_use_result":{"content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"answer\\\":\\\"Based on my search of the context filesystem, I found the answer in the KIP-1312 discussion thread.\\\\n\\\\n**The error code returned when a client tries to unregister a controller ID that has no existing registration is: `BROKER_ID_NOT_REGISTERED`**\\\\n\\\\nThis is explicitly mentioned in Kevin Wu's reply to David Arthur's question about error codes for the unregister controller feature:\\\\n\\\\n> \\\\\\\"a `BROKER_ID_NOT_REGISTERED` error if no registration exists for the requested controller ID\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n**Source file:** `/store/events/2026/05/08/mail-34fa83dae238a6129c835a60-42a38647.md` (lines 47-48)\\\\n\\\\nThis is from the discussion thread on KIP-1312: Support unregistering controllers, where Kevin Wu outlines the error codes that can be returned for this feature.\\\",\\\"error\\\":null,\\\"files\\\":[\\\"store\\\",\\\"events/2026/05/08/mail-34fa83dae238a6129c835a60-42a38647.md\\\"],\\\"seconds\\\":23.91,\\\"truncated\\\":false,\\\"turns\\\":2,\\\"usage\\\":{\\\"cache_read_tokens\\\":133191,\\\"cache_write_tokens\\\":38691,\\\"cost_usd\\\":0.0979671,\\\"input_tokens\\\":66,\\\"output_tokens\\\":1440}}\"}","_meta":{"fastmcp":{"wrap_result":true}},"structuredContent":{"result":"{\"answer\":\"Based on my search of the context filesystem, I found the answer in the KIP-1312 discussion thread.\\n\\n**The error code returned when a client tries to unregister a controller ID that has no existing registration is: `BROKER_ID_NOT_REGISTERED`**\\n\\nThis is explicitly mentioned in Kevin Wu's reply to David Arthur's question about error codes for the unregister controller feature:\\n\\n> \\\"a `BROKER_ID_NOT_REGISTERED` error if no registration exists for the requested controller ID\\\"\\n\\n**Source file:** `/store/events/2026/05/08/mail-34fa83dae238a6129c835a60-42a38647.md` (lines 47-48)\\n\\nThis is from the discussion thread on KIP-1312: Support unregistering controllers, where Kevin Wu outlines the error codes that can be returned for this feature.\",\"error\":null,\"files\":[\"store\",\"events/2026/05/08/mail-34fa83dae238a6129c835a60-42a38647.md\"],\"seconds\":23.91,\"truncated\":false,\"turns\":2,\"usage\":{\"cache_read_tokens\":133191,\"cache_write_tokens\":38691,\"cost_usd\":0.0979671,\"input_tokens\":66,\"output_tokens\":1440}}"}}}
